# The README's gallery of the Garden page (tools/gen_screens.sh). It runs on a freshly started FM-1, not after
# manual_screens.xy, whose leftover state changes the plants. Each built-in song loads from LOAD PROJECT, plays from the
# Song page and the Garden opens to show it. Shots are named garden_NAME.png and gen_screens.sh keeps only the picture.
# The glitch (default soft) and seed knobs are session-only and are put back after their shots. The glitch shots come
# first, because a glitch starts on a beat the song picks and earlier songs move which beats the shots land on; a muted
# track makes the song unsaved (the next load would ask), so that shot is last.
wait 300
# glitches first, wild, while the simulator is fresh: a tear then a blocky blur on the house song, a fold on the synthwave song
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
turn ALGO 3
rowdemo 1
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 1
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
turn K1 3
wait 63750
shot garden_tear.png
wait 1500
shot garden_blocky.png
tap PLAY
settle
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
turn ALGO 1
rowdemo 2
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 2
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
wait 104500
shot garden_fold.png
tap PLAY
settle
turn K1 -2
# a song starts from the Song page, then the Garden opens while it plays
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
turn ALGO -1
rowdemo 1
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 1
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
wait 60000
shot garden_house.png
tap PLAY
settle
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
turn ALGO 1
rowdemo 2
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 2
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
wait 105000
shot garden_synth.png
tap PLAY
settle
# the first bars of Afterglow, most of the garden asleep, then the whole song in
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
turn ALGO 1
rowdemo 3
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 3
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
wait 15000
shot garden_waking.png
wait 105000
shot garden_after.png
tap PLAY
settle
# the same song with the seed at 37: another garden
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
rowdemo 3
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 3
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
turn K2 37
wait 120000
shot garden_seed.png
tap PLAY
settle
turn K2 -37
# four of the eight tracks muted: their plants wilt, the others stand
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
wait 40
turn ALGO -2
rowdemo 1
tap SEL
wait 800
expect demo 1
expect ask 0
expect page Arrange
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Garden
wait 75000
midi B0 09 7F
midi B2 09 7F
midi B4 09 7F
midi B6 09 7F
wait 2500
shot garden_muted.png
tap PLAY
settle
